per\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_anonymous-pro\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">Colony Sim</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_5395737\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://likeaplus.itch.io/colony-sim/purchase\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h1>Build a colony from nothing. Keep it alive.</h1>\r\n<p><strong>Colony Sim</strong> is a from-scratch colony survival simulation: gather resources, build structures, research technology, farm the land, and defend against whatever the night brings &mdash; while six colonists with real needs, real skills and real names try not to fall apart.</p>\r\n<h2>What&#x27;s inside (v1.0.0 &mdash; First Release)</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Needs-driven colonists</strong> &mdash; hunger, energy, mood, hygiene, comfort and bladder all matter, and colonists act on them autonomously, or take direct orders from you</li>\r\n  <li><strong>A full production chain</strong> &mdash; gather wood, stone and fiber, craft tools, apparel and furniture, and build a real settlement tile by tile</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Research &amp; skills</strong> &mdash; unlock the Neolithic tech tree while colonists level up construction, mining, crafting, cooking and more from the work they actually do</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Farming</strong> &mdash; till the land, plant, water and harvest on a real day-length growth cycle</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Three biomes</strong> &mdash; grassland, snow and desert, each with its own resources and wildlife</li>\r\n  <li><strong>A dungeon expedition</strong> &mdash; form a caravan, delve into a procedurally generated cave for ore and treasure, and make it home alive</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Real stakes</strong> &mdash; night brings hostile prowlers, and the threat escalates the longer your colony survives; pick your difficulty (Peaceful / Standard / Savage) in Settings</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Full save &amp; load</strong> &mdash; pick up your colony exactly where you left it</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Controls</h2>\r\n<p>Mouse-driven, with a handful of keyboard shortcuts &mdash; the in-game <strong>Controls</strong> card (Settings \u25b8 Controls) lists everything.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><em>Colony Sim is under active development. Feedback, bug reports and ideas are welcome &mdash; join the Discord or open an issue on GitHub (links above).</em></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_3185788\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"28 August 2026 @ 03:39 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 6 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"26 August 2026 @ 18:32 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 7 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/g